          <p class="compare3-block__brand-copy">A popular alternative solution</p>
        </div>
        <div class="compare3-block__cell compare3-block__feature"><span>👥</span><strong>Team Overview</strong></div>
        <div class="compare3-block__cell compare3-block__value compare3-block__value--highlight"><span class="compare3-block__status compare3-block__status--ok">✓</span><span>Comprehensive dashboard</span></div>
        <div class="compare3-block__cell compare3-block__value"><span class="compare3-block__status compare3-block__status--bad">−</span><span>Basic overview only</span></div>

        <div class="compare3-block__cell compare3-block__feature"><span>🏷️</span><strong>Custom Branding</strong></div>
